# Hemlow Lanes: a kart course in Hemlow's honey-stone country.
# Units in metres: x east, z south, from the world's north-west corner.
#
# The lanes follow old field boundaries, so most of the lap is short runs
# and square field corners between drystone walls. It starts on the village
# green, runs the three corners of Mill Lane, humps over the brook just
# before a corner, crosses the water meadow and the Hem at the ford, climbs
# a combe in Hemlow Edge with two hairpins, takes the one long curve along
# the top of the Edge, and comes down a hollow way to the green.
track hemlow_lanes size 512 style oolite
title HEMLOW LANES
blurb Honey-stone lanes on a midsummer evening: square field corners between drystone walls, a humpback bridge, a ford across the Hem, a climb up a combe in Hemlow Edge and a long curve along its top.
race laps 3 rivals 5 vehicle kart
road 11 bank 1.4
land 30 2
hour 19.5
materials verge lawn_grass

