# No walls: grass run-off either side the whole way, which a kart can run
# wide onto and come back from. The green and the run onto it are wider.
# The hollow way is cut down into the Edge, its banks rising off the
# run-off.
verge 540 590 river_gravel 6

# The ford across the Hem, its far bank's pad.
