# Width: 11 m lanes. The green is wide for the start; Mill Lane's three
# corners are narrow between the field walls, and narrowest over the
# humpback; the water meadow and the ford open out; the hairpins have room;
# the top of the Edge is a fast open curve; the hollow way is a sunk lane.
